### Create custom analytics board
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reports/boards
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Kollektor Boshqaruvi",
  "description": "Kunlik PTP va undirish ko'rsatkichlari",
  "isDefault": true
}

### List boards
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reports/boards
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get board by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reports/boards/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add widget to board
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reports/boards/1/widgets
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Muvaffaqiyatli qo'ng'iroqlar dinamikasi",
  "widgetType": "LINE_CHART",
  "metric": "SUCCESS_RATE",
  "groupBy": "DATE",
  "timeRange": "LAST_7_DAYS",
  "gridRow": 0,
  "gridCol": 0,
  "gridWidth": 12,
  "gridHeight": 4
}

### Query analytics ad-hoc
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reports/boards/query
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "metric": "PTP_COUNT",
  "groupBy": "DATE"
}
